  "description": "A true Wethepeople icon, the Thrillseeker has been helping riders take their first steps into BMX for over two decades. Originally developed around the idea of creating a bike that fit the rider better, the Thrillseeker continues that philosophy today with a complete range of sizes designed to suit riders of all ages and abilities. Available in four sizes from S to XL, the Thrillseeker makes it easier than ever to find the perfect fit from day one. Lightweight, durable, and packed with proven components, it's the ideal entry point into BMX and a solid platform for riders looking to progress. Whether it's your first session at the skatepark or your first ride around the neighborhood, the Thrillseeker is built to make every ride count.",
